The smell's from the notebook!

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:50.372
You two suck! I thought we were friends!

00:13:50.441 --> 00:13:52.910
I was going to say exactly
the same thing to you!

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:54.707
We all slept for an hour,

00:13:54.779 --> 00:13:57.907
but it looks like it didn't have
the power to erase our memories.

00:13:58.282 --> 00:14:00.184
Anyway, no more end runs!

00:14:00.184 --> 00:14:00.946
Right!

00:14:01.018 --> 00:14:01.848
Let's play fair.

00:14:04.789 --> 00:14:05.790
Just the Doc?

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:07.781
Were did Mr. Minamoto go?

00:14:10.027 --> 00:14:10.652
Huh?

00:14:11.228 --> 00:14:12.363
What's wrong?

00:14:12.363 --> 00:14:14.729
I can't read his memories for the last hour.

00:14:15.499 --> 00:14:19.026
No notebook... Meaning it's
either with the chief or Granny!

00:14:19.570 --> 00:14:21.472
The other two still haven't noticed!

00:14:21.472 --> 00:14:22.996
I'll teleport right now and then...

00:14:23.274 --> 00:14:25.543
What are you plotting?!

00:14:25.543 --> 00:14:27.101
What about the promise?!

00:14:30.748 --> 00:14:34.418
Good grief, look at how she sleeps.
It's disgraceful.

00:14:34.418 --> 00:14:37.688
She'll always be a kid,
no matter how many decades pass.

00:14:37.688 --> 00:14:39.315
You should talk.

00:14:39.790 --> 00:14:40.620
Okay.

00:14:44.862 --> 00:14:47.998
That's rewritten all of BABEL's systems.

00:14:47.998 --> 00:14:51.902
They'll never notice that
I've faked my own data, as well.

00:14:51.902 --> 00:14:53.938
Is that what we were after this time?

00:14:53.938 --> 00:14:54.870
Pretty much.

00:14:55.272 --> 00:14:58.969
I also found a spare portable limiter release.

00:14:59.543 --> 00:15:03.240
Even you couldn't stop me from sneaking in.

00:15:03.681 --> 00:15:06.050
Prepare yourself for the coming attack.

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:08.919
We should just take out BABEL right now.

00:15:08.919 --> 00:15:10.654
Some other time.

00:15:10.654 --> 00:15:11.643
Why?

00:15:13.157 --> 00:15:16.285
How do I put it?
I feel like fooling around right now.

00:15:18.229 --> 00:15:19.059
The smell!

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:21.198
Now, next will be...

00:15:21.198 --> 00:15:22.333
There he is!

00:15:22.333 --> 00:15:23.527
Minamoto!

00:15:23.934 --> 00:15:25.569
Okay, we begin the decision!

00:15:25.569 --> 00:15:27.037
Ready for this?

00:15:27.037 --> 00:15:28.072
Bring it on!

00:15:28.072 --> 00:15:29.740
I'm writing "Mr. Minamoto falls head
over heels for one of The Children."

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:31.976
Mr. Minamoto falls head over
heels for one of The Children!
I'm writing "Mr. Minamoto falls head
over heels for one of The Children."

00:15:31.976 --> 00:15:32.309
I'm writing "Mr. Minamoto falls head
over heels for one of The Children."

00:15:32.309 --> 00:15:33.244
Sound good?

00:15:33.244 --> 00:15:35.346
And no hard feelings, whoever he choses, okay?

00:15:35.346 --> 00:15:36.813
Bring it on! I'm ready for it!

00:15:37.414 --> 00:15:38.574
I see.

00:15:39.116 --> 00:15:39.946
Who?!

00:15:40.317 --> 00:15:41.252
Who?!

00:15:41.252 --> 00:15:42.887
Which of us do you love?!

00:15:42.887 --> 00:15:44.479
Am I the god?!

00:15:44.622 --> 00:15:46.023
What sort of foolishness are you...

00:15:46.023 --> 00:15:47.081
Trouble!
What sort of foolishness are you...

00:15:47.391 --> 00:15:49.586
Tim and Barrett have disappeared!

00:15:50.261 --> 00:15:52.162
It might have been Black Phantom!

00:15:52.162 --> 00:15:53.330
Oh, no!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:55.491
Is it possible their hypnosis
wasn't completely broken?

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.763
Then we need to save them, fast!

00:15:58.502 --> 00:16:00.104
Children, move out!

00:16:00.104 --> 00:16:00.729
Right!

00:16:01.171 --> 00:16:03.867
The Children, released!

00:16:04.508 --> 00:16:04.974
<<RELEASED>>

00:16:06.343 --> 00:16:09.013
A strong wish will surely come true!

00:16:09.013 --> 00:16:11.106
Don't give up on your dreams!

00:16:11.749 --> 00:16:14.081
The strength of feelings will change the world!

00:16:14.818 --> 00:16:16.979
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:16:26.764 --> 00:16:27.698
Give it back!

00:16:27.698 --> 00:16:28.532
It's mine!

00:16:28.532 --> 00:16:29.521
What?

00:16:30.668 --> 00:16:32.269
Hey! Where is it?!

00:16:32.269 --> 00:16:32.928
What?

00:16:33.537 --> 00:16:35.129
You guys!

00:16:35.773 --> 00:16:36.501
Over there, too!

00:16:41.145 --> 00:16:42.237
Where'd he go?!

00:16:43.113 --> 00:16:44.205
Over there!

00:16:48.052 --> 00:16:49.519
Welcome back!

00:16:52.189 --> 00:16:53.991
Why did you run away?

00:16:53.991 --> 00:16:58.095
Tell us the truth! Does Black
Phantom still have a link with you?

00:16:58.095 --> 00:17:00.397
We said we didn't!

00:17:00.397 --> 00:17:02.160
We wanted the notebook!

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:07.471
Mr. Obata talked about a notebook that
grants wishes and changes the future!

00:17:07.471 --> 00:17:10.770
But it wasn't there. The old man made it up!

00:17:13.043 --> 00:17:14.340
No, he didn't.

00:17:16.280 --> 00:17:18.942
If you have a wish, try writing it in here.

00:17:24.288 --> 00:17:25.380
Get memories ba...

00:17:26.824 --> 00:17:27.950
Bring back my lost mem...

00:17:29.126 --> 00:17:30.227
I can't!

00:17:30.227 --> 00:17:31.462
I can't write it!

00:17:31.462 --> 00:17:32.429
Why not?

00:17:32.429 --> 00:17:34.124
You want your memories back, don't you?

00:17:34.465 --> 00:17:38.402
Yes! I can't stand not knowing my own name!

00:17:38.402 --> 00:17:39.570
Then, why?

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:43.097
Because if we get our lost memories back,
it'll make it even harder for us!

00:17:45.809 --> 00:17:47.845
Let's not play with him anymore.

00:17:47.845 --> 00:17:49.176
Get out of here, you monster!

00:17:49.813 --> 00:17:54.118
Somehow, I know the memories
of my past are all painful.

00:17:54.118 --> 00:17:57.884
I lost everything, so I have
no wishes I want to come true.

00:18:01.191 --> 00:18:02.283
That's not true!

00:18:03.227 --> 00:18:05.320
Don't say you don't have any wishes!

00:18:11.769 --> 00:18:14.602
Okay, how about this?

00:18:15.806 --> 00:18:17.330
Let them both make friends.

00:18:18.575 --> 00:18:20.778
There, that's not so bad, right?

00:18:20.778 --> 00:18:23.180
Oh, there you are.

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:24.545
I finally found you.

00:18:25.082 --> 00:18:28.745
Isn't this yours, Tim? You dropped it.

00:18:29.353 --> 00:18:30.752
That's!

00:18:31.088 --> 00:18:34.358
That's a Tora-Mate limited
edition Chiru-Chiru strap figure!

00:18:34.358 --> 00:18:35.757
H-How do you know that?!

00:18:36.293 --> 00:18:41.060
Well, the truth is I'm secretly the moderator
of the "Absolutely Chiru-Chiru" forums.

00:18:41.665 --> 00:18:44.234
You mean, you're "Chiru-Chiru is Mai Waifu"?!

00:18:44.234 --> 00:18:46.225
You and I were chatting yesterday!

00:18:46.470 --> 00:18:49.640
Y-You're "Chiru-Chiru's Cute! Chiru-Chiru"?!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:50.436
Yeah!

00:18:53.944 --> 00:18:55.172
Soul brother!

00:18:56.547 --> 00:19:00.150
I guess that's what they've
been staying up all night doing.

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:02.219
They seem kind of creepily in to it.

00:19:02.219 --> 00:19:03.454
REALLY into it.

00:19:03.454 --> 00:19:06.480
Still, they really seem to have hit it off.

00:19:07.791 --> 00:19:09.884
It turned out just like what
was written in the notebook.

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:11.428
Yeah.

00:19:11.428 --> 00:19:12.930
It's incredible, all right.

00:19:12.930 --> 00:19:15.091
That wasn't the power of the notebook.

00:19:15.866 --> 00:19:18.164
You were the ones who wished that, right?

00:19:18.635 --> 00:19:24.198
Maybe your psychic power is
to bring happiness to espers.

00:19:25.209 --> 00:19:28.406
O-Our power? Maybe it is.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:34.184
Oh, yeah! Minamoto, you never
answered which one of us you chose!

00:19:34.184 --> 00:19:34.985
Yeah!

00:19:34.985 --> 00:19:36.420
Answer us straight!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:39.823
Now, don't be ridiculous. I love all of you...

00:19:39.823 --> 00:19:41.085
That won't cut it!

00:19:41.458 --> 00:19:45.224
You've gotta give us a straight answer
for once! If you don't, we'll...

00:19:48.065 --> 00:19:50.499
We'll get so sad, we'll run off somewhere!

00:19:59.343 --> 00:20:02.870
Grow up, as fast as you can.
Then you'll get my answer.

00:20:03.714 --> 00:20:06.049
I really do await that day.

00:20:06.049 --> 00:20:08.449
It's for that reason that I still live.

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:11.682
There's something different about him.

00:20:12.422 --> 00:20:13.889
But this Mr. Minamoto is great!

00:20:14.324 --> 00:20:15.882
My... My heart is soaring!

00:20:16.226 --> 00:20:18.956
Is this moe?! Am I getting moe for him?!

00:20:19.096 --> 00:20:22.366
To heck with playing fair!
I'm writing it down!

00:20:22.366 --> 00:20:24.101
Don't! Don't you dare!

00:20:24.101 --> 00:20:25.702
Am I the god of the new world?!

00:20:25.702 --> 00:20:28.068
Kaoru will gladly die for her Koichi!

00:20:29.072 --> 00:20:29.538
Idiot!

00:20:40.017 --> 00:20:41.018
Kyosuke!

00:20:41.018 --> 00:20:42.645
You've been tricking us all along!

00:20:42.719 --> 00:20:44.380
Wait, hear me oooOOOWWWW!

00:20:48.091 --> 00:20:50.394
And what have you been
playing around with now?

00:20:50.394 --> 00:20:52.996
If you're finished,
could you please come back?

00:20:52.996 --> 00:20:53.724
This.

00:20:54.431 --> 00:20:55.365
Damn it.

00:20:55.365 --> 00:20:57.595
The man who took the notebook
will fool around happily until its
effectiveness is used up. (Obata)
The old man was ready for me.

00:20:57.901 --> 00:21:00.768
It must have run out of juice today.

00:21:01.872 --> 00:21:05.672
No matter. The truth is, I had a lot of fun.

00:21:07.544 --> 00:21:11.415
That's a relief. Those two are much happier now.

00:21:11.415 --> 00:21:13.747
To be honest, I was a little worried.

00:21:14.117 --> 00:21:18.155
I wasn't sure if I should take
the notebook you buried first...

00:21:18.155 --> 00:21:22.091
It's all right. I meant to
give it to you from the start.

00:21:23.427 --> 00:21:24.689
Thank you so much!

00:21:25.229 --> 00:21:28.298
So, have you written any wishes in it yet?

00:21:28.298 --> 00:21:29.166
Yes!

00:21:29.166 --> 00:21:30.929
I already wrote down three of them!

00:21:31.401 --> 00:21:34.700
Let's see..."I hope the
weather tomorrow is nice."

00:21:35.906 --> 00:21:39.009
Next, "I hope the laundry dries quickly."

00:21:39.009 --> 00:21:42.246
And then "I hope dinner
cooks up nice and tasty!"

00:21:42.246 --> 00:21:44.448
You think I'm being too greedy?

00:21:44.448 --> 00:21:46.116
Not at all.

00:21:46.116 --> 00:21:46.946
AND SO...

00:21:48.085 --> 00:21:50.254
It's true, our first wish...

00:21:50.254 --> 00:21:52.256
Did kind of come true...

00:21:52.256 --> 00:21:54.588
He did come back a little sooner, but...

00:21:56.627 --> 00:22:00.397
My butt... My feet... My back...
They accidentally sent you out
for special forces training, huh?

00:22:00.397 --> 00:22:03.230
We didn't want him to
come home looking like this!

00:22:05.135 --> 00:22:06.737
Yes! It's on!

00:22:06.737 --> 00:22:07.304
Aw, man!

00:22:07.304 --> 00:22:08.405
I'm gonna moe to death!

00:22:08.405 --> 00:22:09.372
Watch it together!

00:22:19.516 --> 00:22:24.613
Kakushitemo muda da yo

00:22:24.955 --> 00:22:29.016
Nandemo zenbu wakaru

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:35.198
Fushigi ja nai yo datte atashi wa

00:22:35.565 --> 00:22:40.969
Anata wo ai shite n da mon

00:22:41.204 --> 00:22:45.607
Hora kochi muite

00:22:45.876 --> 00:22:50.180
Maji de love x love musubareru no wa

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:52.148
Zettai nan desu!!

00:22:52.382 --> 00:22:57.087
Zutto eien fuhen

00:22:57.087 --> 00:23:03.727
Everest kara sekaiju ni zettai sengen!!

00:23:03.727 --> 00:23:08.565
Mou uketomete

00:23:08.565 --> 00:23:12.969
Futari love x love musubareru no wa

00:23:12.969 --> 00:23:15.172
Zettai nan desu!!

00:23:15.172 --> 00:23:19.609
Yappa daian kibou

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:24.014
San Pietro de chikau ai no

00:23:24.014 --> 00:23:26.812
Zettai sengen!!

00:23:40.097 --> 00:23:40.964
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:40.964 --> 00:23:41.998
NEXT EPISODE
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.998 --> 00:23:43.133
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:43.133 --> 00:23:44.334
Hello, you three.

00:23:44.334 --> 00:23:45.502
Congratulations on moving up a grade.

00:23:45.502 --> 00:23:47.026
You're that much closer to adulthood now.

00:23:47.337 --> 00:23:48.205
Major Hyobu?

00:23:48.205 --> 00:23:49.502
That's kind of a new look.

00:23:49.573 --> 00:23:50.562
Kind of?

00:23:50.640 --> 00:23:53.744
I just had to celebrate your growth with you!

00:23:53.744 --> 00:23:54.870
You'll go out with me, won't you?

00:23:55.178 --> 00:23:56.611
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:56.747 --> 00:24:00.550
Episode 47: "Life's Troubles Are But
a Dream! Memories of Tomorrow"

00:24:00.550 --> 00:24:04.077
Ever since Minamoto came,
we've all changed! Completely!

00:24:04.154 --> 00:24:06.757
Kaoru, at the rate you're going, one day...

00:24:06.757 --> 00:24:06.923
Life's Troubles Are But a Dream!
Memories of Tomorrow
Kaoru, at the rate you're going, one day...

00:24:06.923 --> 00:24:09.025
Life's Troubles Are But a Dream!
Memories of Tomorrow
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

